==English==

{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
A calque of {{etyl|fr|-}} {{term|pomme d'Adam|lang=fr}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[Adam]]'s [[apple]]}}

# {{context|anatomy|lang=en}} The [[lump]] in the [[throat]], usually more [[noticeable]] in [[men]] than in [[women]]; the [[laryngeal prominence]].
# A common name for ''Tabernaemontana divaricata'', a fragrant [[house plant]] native to southeast Asia.

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|anatomy}} [[laryngeal prominence]]
* {{sense|Tabernaemontana divaricata}} [[crape jasmine]], [[pinwheel flower]], [[Nero's crown]], [[butterfly gardenia]], [[carnation of India]], [[East Indian rosebay]], ''Tabernaemontana coronaria'', [[coffee rose]], [[crepe gardenia]]

